                <div class="material-problem-panel__inner grid gap-4 border-t border-rw-line pt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-rw-muted sm:grid-cols-2"><p><strong class="text-rw-forest">Penyebab:</strong> {problem.cause}</p><p><strong class="text-rw-forest">Perbaikan:</strong> {problem.fix}</p></div>
